WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.240
We literally have the 911 audio of the stand-out order in Chicago,

00:04.520 --> 00:12.040
and we have documented inside of DHS every single unresponded to 911 call over the recent weeks and months.

00:12.260 --> 00:15.120
Do you have evidence that this campaign is coordinated?

00:15.420 --> 00:19.020
Are you planning charges on anyone who is actually coordinating said campaign?

